  "project": "Ticketly, a one-page event-booking site selling seats for Harbour Lights, a weekend music festival. It starts out the way many real pages do: div soup, unlabeled inputs, a mouse-only seat picker, a modal that traps nobody and a checkout that screen readers can't follow. Each lesson audits one part of Ticketly and fixes it, until the whole page passes a WCAG 2.2 AA audit.",
